flowchart LR
    A[Person image A] --> P[Resize 128 x 64\nRGB normalization]
    B[Person image B] --> P2[Resize 128 x 64\nRGB normalization]
    P --> E[Siamese CNN encoder\nshared weights]
    P2 --> E
    E --> Z1[128D normalized\nembedding A]
    E --> Z2[128D normalized\nembedding B]
    Z1 --> D[Contrastive distance\ntraining]
    Z2 --> D
    D --> L[Contrastive loss\nmargin 1.0]
    L --> U[AdamW update]
    G[Gallery images] --> GE[Same encoder]
    GE --> GI[Precomputed gallery embeddings]
    Q[Browser query] --> QE[ONNX encoder]
    QE --> S[Cosine similarity\nnearest-neighbor search]
    GI --> S
    S --> R[Top matches]
